e/timestamp informationNonstandardCareProcedure body/informationNonstandard CareProcedure/time/timestamp eller body/informationNonstandard CareProcedure/time/timePeriod/start Contagion body/contagion/time/timestamp eller body/contagion/time/timePeriod/start unstructuredAlertInformation header/record/timestamp#xA;Format enligt XSD (TimeStampType): ÅÅÅÅMMDDttmmss.\">blockComparisonTime</a><a name=\"SEEHDSLMAlertInformationV30.alertInformation.header.accessControlHeader.blockComparisonTime\"> </a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"/><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\">1..1</td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><a href=\"StructureDefinition-SEEHDSRivTimeStamp.html\">SEEHDSRivTimeStamp</a></td><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: white; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px\" class=\"hierarchy\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">XML-namnrymd: </span>urn:riv:clinicalprocess:healthcond:description:3<br/>Den tidpunkt mot vilken spärrkontroll sker vid åtkomst med syftet sammanhållen journalföring för kontroll av …<br/><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">XML-namnrymd: </span>urn:riv:clinicalprocess:healthcond:description:3</td></tr>#xD;\n<tr style=\"border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px; vertical-align: top; background-color: #F7F7F7\"><td style=\"vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px; white-space: nowrap; background-image: url(tbl_bck11100.png)\" class=\"hierarchy\"><img src=\"tbl_spacer.png\" alt=\".\" style=\"background-color: inherit\"